<title>UK: Konica unit sets $300 mln EMTN programme.</title>
<headline>Konica unit sets $300 mln EMTN programme.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Konica Finance USA Corp and Konica Capital EC (Holland) B.V. have set up a $300 million Euro medium-term note (EMTN) programme, the companies said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Application has been made to admit the programme to the official list at the London Stock Exchange, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
